        "name": "One Who Surpasses the Storm, Thavas",
        "text": "[AUTO](VC)[Generation Break 2](This ability is active if you have two or more face up G units in total on your (VC) or G zone):When this unit attacks a vanguard, if it is the fourth battle of that turn or more, until end of that battle, this unit gets [Critical] +1, and your opponent cannot call grade 0 cards from hand to (GC).\n[AUTO](VC):During your turn, when your G unit [Stride], choose one of your vanguards, until end of turn, it gets \"[AUTO](VC):When your unit attacks a vanguard, if it is the fourth battle of that turn, choose three of your opponent's rear-guards, your opponent chooses one card from them, and retires it.\".",
